# AG3NT v2.0 — Ground-Up Rebuild Using PAI Architecture

> **Goal:** Rebuild AG3NT from scratch, adopting the architecture, patterns, and systems from the Personal AI Infrastructure (PAI) project while preserving AG3NT's unique value: local-first multi-model agent platform with Gateway + Agent Worker + Web UI.

---

## Background & Analysis

### What AG3NT Has Today
| Component | Tech | Status |
|-----------|------|--------|
| **Gateway** | TypeScript/Express (port 18789) | Functional — HTTP/WS, session routing, channel adapters |
| **Agent Worker** | Python/DeepAgents (port 18790) | Functional — 69 modules, LLM inference, tool execution |
| **Web UI** | Next.js/React/Tailwind (port 3000) | Functional — chat, artifacts, skills browser |
| **TUI** | TypeScript | Basic terminal client |
| **Skills** | 10 bundled (flat format) | Basic — no workflow routing, no USE WHEN triggers |
| **Memory** | SQLite sessions only | Minimal — no learning, no structured capture |
| **Security** | HITL + DM pairing | Basic approval flows |
| **Integrations** | 370+ community modules | Extensive but unstructured |

### What PAI Brings (To Adopt)
| System | Description | AG3NT Benefit |
|--------|-------------|---------------|
| **Skill System** | SKILL.md with YAML frontmatter, USE WHEN triggers, workflow routing, TitleCase naming | Structured, self-activating skills that route intelligently |
| **Memory System** | WORK/, LEARNING/, RESEARCH/, SECURITY/, STATE/ — 7-directory architecture | Persistent learning that compounds across sessions |
| **Hook System** | 21 event-driven hooks across 7 lifecycle events | Automated capture, voice, security, session management |
| **Algorithm** | 7-phase (Observe→Think→Plan→Build→Execute→Verify→Learn) with ISC criteria | Systematic task execution with verifiable outcomes |
| **Agent Personalities** | 14 specialized agents with unique voices and behaviors | Specialized task delegation (Engineer, Architect, Researcher) |
| **TELOS** | 10 goal files (MISSION, GOALS, PROJECTS, BELIEFS, etc.) | User-centric goal understanding |
| **Voice/Notifications** | ElevenLabs TTS, ntfy push, Discord alerts | Multi-channel notifications with voice feedback |
| **User/System Separation** | USER/ for customizations, SYSTEM/ for infrastructure | Upgrade-safe personal configurations |
| **Security Architecture** | SecurityValidator hooks, AllowList, sensitive path protection | Production-grade security without blocking workflows |
| **Settings.json** | Single source of truth for all configuration | Centralized, programmatic configuration |

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **This is a major rebuild** — the project structure will change significantly. All existing AG3NT functionality will be preserved but reorganized.

> [!WARNING]
> **Breaking changes to existing AG3NT users:**
> - Skill format changes (old skills must be migrated to SKILL.md format)
> - New directory structure (MEMORY/, hooks/, agents/)
> - Config format changes (settings.json replaces scattered config)
> - Gateway API endpoints may change to support new systems

> [!CAUTION]
> **Decision needed:** Should we keep the Python Agent Worker as-is and add new systems around it, or should we migrate some Python modules to TypeScript for consistency with PAI's Bun/TS approach? **Recommendation:** Keep Python worker for LLM inference (it's working) but add a new TypeScript layer for Hook/Memory/Algorithm systems that runs alongside it.

---

## Proposed Changes

The rebuild is organized into **6 phases**, each building on the previous:

---

### Phase 1: Foundation — Configuration & Directory Structure

Establish the PAI-inspired directory structure and centralized configuration.

#### [NEW] [settings.json](file:///g:/apexai/AG3NT-main/config/settings.json)
- Central configuration file modeled after PAI's `settings.json`
- Contains: `daidentity` (AG3NT name, color, voice), `principal` (user info), `env`, `permissions`, `hooks` config
- Single source of truth replacing scattered `.env` and `config.yaml` files

#### [NEW] MEMORY directory tree
```
AG3NT-main/
├── MEMORY/
│   ├── WORK/              # Active task tracking with PRD.md files
│   ├── LEARNING/          # Categorized learnings
│   │   ├── SYSTEM/        # Infrastructure learnings
│   │   ├── ALGORITHM/     # Task execution learnings
│   │   ├── FAILURES/      # Full context failure dumps
│   │   ├── SYNTHESIS/     # Aggregated pattern analysis
│   │   ├── REFLECTIONS/   # Algorithm performance reflections
│   │   └── SIGNALS/       # User satisfaction ratings
│   ├── RESEARCH/          # Agent output captures
│   ├── SECURITY/          # Security audit events
│   ├── STATE/             # Runtime state (ephemeral)
│   │   ├── algorithms/    # Per-session algorithm state
│   │   ├── events.jsonl   # Unified event log
│   │   └── current-work.json
│   └── README.md
```

#### [NEW] USER directory (upgrade-safe customizations)
```
AG3NT-main/
├── USER/
│   ├── TELOS/             # User goal files
│   │   ├── MISSION.md
│   │   ├── GOALS.md
│   │   ├── PROJECTS.md
│   │   ├── BELIEFS.md
│   │   ├── MODELS.md
│   │   ├── STRATEGIES.md
│   │   ├── NARRATIVES.md
│   │   ├── LEARNED.md
│   │   ├── CHALLENGES.md
│   │   └── IDEAS.md
│   ├── PREFERENCES.md     # User preferences
│   ├── CONTACTS.md        # Contact info
│   ├── TECHSTACK.md       # Tech preferences
│   └── SKILLCUSTOMIZATIONS/  # Per-skill overrides
```

#### [MODIFY] [.env.example](file:///g:/apexai/AG3NT-main/.env.example)
- Add new env vars: `AG3NT_DIR`, `AG3NT_MEMORY_DIR`, `AG3NT_VOICE_ENABLED`, `AG3NT_VOICE_PROVIDER`

