### Phase 2: Skill System Overhaul

Migrate all 10 skills to PAI's canonical SKILL.md format.

#### [MODIFY] All 10 skill directories under `skills/`
Restructure each to follow PAI's canonical format:

```
skills/
├── AppLauncher/           # Renamed from app-launcher (TitleCase)
│   ├── SKILL.md           # YAML frontmatter + USE WHEN + workflow routing
│   ├── Workflows/
│   │   ├── Launch.md
│   │   └── List.md
│   └── Tools/
│       └── Launch.ts
├── DailyBriefing/         # Renamed from daily-briefing
├── DeepReasoning/         # Renamed from deep-reasoning
├── FileManager/           # Renamed from file-manager
├── Heartbeat/             # Renamed from heartbeat
├── SystemInfo/            # Renamed from system-info
├── VoiceTTS/              # Renamed from voice-tts
├── WebResearch/           # Renamed from web-research
├── CameraCapture/         # Renamed from camera-capture
├── BrowserControl/        # NEW - browser automation skill
├── _SYSTEM/               # NEW - system management (personal, never shared)
└── README.md              # Updated skill development guide
```

**Each `SKILL.md` follows PAI's canonical format:**
```yaml
---
name: WebResearch
description: Web search and scraping. USE WHEN user wants to search the web, find information online, scrape websites, extract content from URLs, OR do internet research.
---

# WebResearch

Web search and content extraction skill.

## Workflow Routing

| Workflow | Trigger | File |
|----------|---------|------|
| **Search** | "search for", "find information" | `Workflows/Search.md` |
| **Scrape** | "scrape", "extract from URL" | `Workflows/Scrape.md` |

## Examples

**Example 1: Web search**
```
User: "Search for the latest AI news"
→ Invokes Search workflow
→ Performs web search via configured provider
→ Returns formatted results with sources
```
```

#### [NEW] [skills/README.md](file:///g:/apexai/AG3NT-main/skills/README.md)
- Comprehensive skill development guide based on PAI's SKILLSYSTEM.md
- Documents SKILL.md format, TitleCase naming, USE WHEN triggers
- Includes canonicalization checklist

