### Phase 3: Hook System Implementation

Implement PAI's event-driven hook architecture adapted for AG3NT's Gateway.

#### [NEW] `hooks/` directory at project root
```
hooks/
├── lib/                   # Shared hook utilities
│   ├── hook-io.ts         # Stdin reading, JSON parsing
│   ├── identity.ts        # Identity module (getDAName, getPrincipal)
│   ├── learning-utils.ts  # Learning categorization
│   ├── time.ts            # PST timestamps, date utilities
│   └── event-emitter.ts   # Unified event log writer
├── handlers/              # Reusable handler functions
│   ├── VoiceNotification.ts
│   ├── TabState.ts
│   └── DocIntegrity.ts
├── SecurityValidator.hook.ts     # Pre-tool validation
├── RatingCapture.hook.ts         # Sentiment & explicit ratings
├── SessionAutoName.hook.ts       # Auto-name sessions
├── WorkCompletionLearning.hook.ts # Learning capture on session end
├── SessionCleanup.hook.ts        # Cleanup on session end
├── LoadContext.hook.ts            # Context injection on session start
├── VoiceCompletion.hook.ts        # Voice TTS on task completion
└── README.md
```

#### [MODIFY] [apps/gateway/src/index.ts](file:///g:/apexai/AG3NT-main/apps/gateway/src/index.ts)
- Add hook lifecycle manager — fires hooks at: SessionStart, SessionEnd, PreToolUse, PostToolUse, UserPromptSubmit, Stop
- Hook events are emitted on the Gateway's WebSocket event bus
- Hooks run asynchronously and fail gracefully (never block the gateway)

#### [NEW] `apps/gateway/src/hooks/hook-manager.ts`
- Central hook orchestrator that reads `settings.json` hook config
- Executes hooks as child processes (TypeScript files via `node --loader ts-node`)
- Passes JSON on stdin (session_id, transcript_path, event data)
- Handles timeouts (500ms default) and graceful failures

---

### Phase 4: Algorithm Engine (7-Phase Execution)

Implement PAI's Algorithm as the core execution engine for complex tasks.

#### [NEW] `apps/agent/ag3nt_agent/algorithm/`
```
algorithm/
├── __init__.py
├── engine.py              # Main Algorithm engine (7-phase orchestrator)
├── phases.py              # Phase implementations (Observe→Learn)
├── prd.py                 # PRD management (create, update, parse)
├── isc.py                 # Ideal State Criteria (decomposition, splitting test)
├── effort.py              # Effort level classification (Standard→Comprehensive)
├── capability_selector.py # Skill/capability selection engine
└── state.py               # Algorithm state persistence
```

#### [MODIFY] [apps/agent/ag3nt_agent/deepagents_runtime.py](file:///g:/apexai/AG3NT-main/apps/agent/ag3nt_agent/deepagents_runtime.py)
- Integrate Algorithm engine as a middleware in the inference pipeline
- Complex tasks automatically enter Algorithm mode
- Simple tasks use existing direct inference (NATIVE mode)

#### [MODIFY] [apps/agent/ag3nt_agent/worker.py](file:///g:/apexai/AG3NT-main/apps/agent/ag3nt_agent/worker.py)
- Add `/api/algorithm/status` endpoint to expose current Algorithm phase
- Add `/api/algorithm/prd` endpoint to serve current PRD state
- Emit algorithm phase transitions as WebSocket events

