### Phase 5: Agent Personality System & Memory Integration

#### [NEW] `agents/` directory at project root
```
agents/
├── Algorithm.md           # Meta-agent for Algorithm execution
├── Architect.md           # System design specialist
├── Engineer.md            # Code implementation specialist
├── Designer.md            # UI/UX specialist
├── Researcher.md          # Research and analysis
├── QATester.md            # Quality assurance
├── SecurityAnalyst.md     # Security specialist
├── BrowserAgent.md        # Browser automation
└── README.md
```

Each agent `.md` file contains:
- **Personality traits** (humor, precision, directness, autonomy — 0-100 scales)
- **Voice configuration** (voice ID for TTS)
- **Specialization** rules and domain expertise
- **Behavioral rules** (when to ask, when to act, communication style)

