## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Voice Provider:** PAI uses ElevenLabs for TTS. Should AG3NT also use ElevenLabs, or do you prefer a different/free TTS provider (e.g., Edge TTS, Google Cloud TTS, Piper)?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **TELOS Pre-population:** Should we create a guided setup wizard that populates TELOS files (MISSION.md, GOALS.md, etc.) interactively on first run?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Existing AG3NT data:** Should we write a migration script that converts existing SQLite session data into the new MEMORY/ format?

